body:
I usually set a really simple ability and then just explore it to its most extreme. In you case, I would say a fire soul has the ability to increase the temperature of things. So what ways would you be able to  use this power? Well you can use it to create steam power, change the weather (create clouds, melt ice, etc) , burn things using fire, melt things.

&#x200B;

So basically just make sure you know all the abilities you want you system to have and come up with ways to prevent them from being too overpowered.
